# Macro returns wrong type: macro transformers must return Expression or Dict.
# This macro returns an Int, which is invalid.
[macro bad-macro [let arg]
  42]

[bad-macro "hello"]
=== error
[E080] macro 'bad-macro' must return Expression or Dict, got Int (defined at 5:1-5:20)

=== warn
[E080] macro 'bad-macro' must return Expression or Dict, got Int (defined at 5:1-5:20)
